OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening with scattered showers, but
OL,7,Fthese slowly dying out. A mostly dry
OL,8,Fnight will follow with variable
OL,9,Famounts of cloud, feeling mild with
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA largely dry day but rather
OL,13,Fcloudy with the best of any brightness
OL,14,Flikely to be in the morning. A little
OL,15,Flight rain at times.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,18,Fstart to Monday then rain spreading
OL,19,Feastwards. Mainly dry on Tuesday then
OL,20,Fbright spells and showers on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
